# Khor Beauty Aesthetics

---

# 🎯 Project Objective

To develop a premium aesthetic medical website designed to:

* Showcase aesthetic treatments
* Provide customer enquiry functionality
* Support appointment booking
* Support deposit payment
* Provide backend content management

---

# 👥 User Roles

## 1️⃣ Customer

Customers are able to:

* Browse the website
* View aesthetic treatments
* View treatment details
* Submit enquiries
* Contact via WhatsApp
* Submit bookings
* Make deposit payments

---

## 2️⃣ Administrator (Admin)

Administrators are able to:

* Login to admin dashboard
* Create / Edit / Delete services
* Upload treatment images
* View customer enquiries
* View booking records
* Update website content

---

# 🌐 Frontend Requirements

---

## Homepage

The homepage should include:

* Hero Section
* Brand Introduction
* Featured Treatments
* Before / After Showcase
* WhatsApp CTA
* Customer Testimonials
* Footer

---

## Treatment Listing Page

The page should include:

* Display all treatments
* Treatment image gallery
* Short description
* Price preview
* View Details button

---

## Treatment Detail Page

The page should include:

* Treatment details
* Treatment images
* Benefits
* Procedure information
* Pricing
* Booking CTA

---

## Booking Form

Customers should be able to:

* Enter full name
* Enter contact number
* Select treatment
* Select appointment date
* Leave additional notes

---

## Enquiry Form

Customers should be able to:

* Submit enquiries
* Leave contact details
* Contact quickly via WhatsApp

---

# 💳 Payment Requirements

The system should support:

* FPX
* TNG eWallet
* Card Payment
* Bank Transfer

---

# ⚙️ Backend Requirements

The backend should support:

* REST API
* Admin Authentication
* Booking Management
* Enquiry Management
* Service CRUD
* Image Upload Handling

---

# 🗄 Database Requirements

The database should store:

## Services

* Service Name
* Description
* Price
* Images

---

## Bookings

* Customer Name
* Contact Number
* Selected Service
* Booking Date
* Payment Status

---

## Enquiries

* Customer Name
* Phone Number
* Message

---

# 📱 Responsive Design Requirements

The website must be:

* Mobile Friendly
* Tablet Responsive
* Desktop Responsive

---

# 🔒 Security Requirements

The system should include:

* Admin Login Authentication
* Basic Form Validation
* Protected Admin Routes
* Secure Payment Handling

---

# 🚀 Performance Requirements

The website should provide:

* Fast Loading Speed
* Optimized Images
* Basic SEO
* Responsive UI
